      "notes": "F-1 alternative install (factual)."
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0005",
      "text": "The base image `mcr.microsoft.com/devcontainers/python:1-3.11-bookworm` provides Python 3.11 but does not have uv pre-installed, so uv must be added via `pip install uv` or the official astral.sh/uv installer.",
      "source_uri": "/workspaces/feature-pipeline/working/feature/devcontainer-mcp-provisioning-r1/research-notes/T-001-serena.md",
      "source_type": "community_blog",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
