      "notes": "F-1 environment setup detail (factual)."
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0006",
      "text": "Upstream README's `uv tool install` example pins Python 3.13, but Python 3.11 is documented elsewhere as compatible (Itecs guide cites Python 3.10 or later).",
      "source_uri": "/workspaces/feature-pipeline/working/feature/devcontainer-mcp-provisioning-r1/research-notes/T-001-serena.md",
      "source_type": "community_blog",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
