      "date": "2026-05-23",
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": "F-1 caveat (recommendation/risk)."
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0009",
      "text": "Serena's default transport for MCP-client integration is stdio: the server is launched as a subprocess of the MCP client and communication is JSON-RPC over stdin/stdout.",
      "source_uri": "/workspaces/feature-pipeline/working/feature/devcontainer-mcp-provisioning-r1/research-notes/T-001-serena.md",
      "source_type": "community_blog",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "claude_code",
      "date": "2026-05-23",
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": "F-2 (factual)."
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0010",
      "text": "Serena's HTTP mode is documented as a 'start the Serena MCP server yourself in HTTP mode and provide the client with the URL' pattern, where the operator runs Serena out-of-band and points the client at it.",
      "source_uri": "/workspaces/feature-pipeline/working/feature/devcontainer-mcp-provisioning-r1/research-notes/T-001-serena.md",
      "source_type": "community_blog",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "claude_code",
      "date": "2026-05-23",
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": "F-2 (factual)."
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0011",
      "text": "SSE is referenced in Serena's changelog (HTTP/SSE mode bug fix in v1.2.0) but is not the documented default for client integrations.",
      "source_uri": "/workspaces/feature-pipeline/working/feature/devcontainer-mcp-provisioning-r1/research-notes/T-001-serena.md",
      "source_type": "community_blog",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "claude_code",
      "date": "2026-05-23",
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": "F-2 (factual)."
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0012",
      "text": "For project-scoped `.mcp.json` always-on use, stdio is the correct transport for Serena.",
      "source_uri": "/workspaces/feature-pipeline/working/feature/devcontainer-mcp-provisioning-r1/research-notes/T-001-serena.md",
      "source_type": "community_blog",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "claude_code",
      "date": "2026-05-23",
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": "F-2 recommendation."
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0013",
      "text": "If the design later wants to share one Serena instance across multiple containers or external clients, HTTP transport would become relevant.",
      "source_uri": "/workspaces/feature-pipeline/working/feature/devcontainer-mcp-provisioning-r1/research-notes/T-001-serena.md",
      "source_type": "community_blog",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "claude_code",
      "date": "2026-05-23",
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": "F-2 caveat (open-question)."
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0014",
      "text": "For Claude Code project-scope, upstream recommends `claude mcp add serena -- serena start-mcp-server --context claude-code --project \"$(pwd)\"`.",
      "source_uri": "/workspaces/feature-pipeline/working/feature/devcontainer-mcp-provisioning-r1/research-notes/T-001-serena.md",
      "source_type": "community_blog",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "claude_code",
      "date": "2026-05-23",
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": "F-3 registration shape (recommendation)."
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0015",
      "text": "The `--context claude-code` flag adapts Serena's tool descriptions and system prompts to Claude Code's conventions.",
      "source_uri": "/workspaces/feature-pipeline/working/feature/devcontainer-mcp-provisioning-r1/research-notes/T-001-serena.md",
      "source_type": "community_blog",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "claude_code",
      "date": "2026-05-23",
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": "F-3 (factual)."
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0016",
      "text": "The `--project` flag binds the Serena server to a specific project root.",
      "source_uri": "/workspaces/feature-pipeline/working/feature/devcontainer-mcp-provisioning-r1/research-notes/T-001-serena.md",
      "source_type": "community_blog",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "claude_code",
      "date": "2026-05-23",
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": "F-3 (factual)."
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0017",
      "text": "When using the uvx form without global install, the equivalent registration is `claude mcp add serena -- uvx --from git+https://github.com/oraios/serena serena start-mcp-server --context ide-assistant --project $(pwd)`.",
      "source_uri": "/workspaces/feature-pipeline/working/feature/devcontainer-mcp-provisioning-r1/research-notes/T-001-serena.md",
      "source_type": "community_blog",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "claude_code",
      "date": "2026-05-23",
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": "F-3 (factual)."
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0018",
      "text": "Both registration forms produce a stdio-transport entry in `.mcp.json` of the standard shape: `{\"command\": \"serena\", \"args\": [\"start-mcp-server\", \"--context\", \"claude-code\", \"--project\", \"<root>\"]}` or with `\"command\": \"uvx\"` and appropriate args list.",
      "source_uri": "/workspaces/feature-pipeline/working/feature/devcontainer-mcp-provisioning-r1/research-notes/T-001-serena.md",
      "source_type": "community_blog",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
