      "notes": "F-3 (factual)."
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0019",
      "text": "Upstream notes that recent Claude Code / Opus model updates have 'drastically reduced adherence to instructions pertaining to Serena's tools' and recommends additional hooks.",
      "source_uri": "/workspaces/feature-pipeline/working/feature/devcontainer-mcp-provisioning-r1/research-notes/T-001-serena.md",
