      "notes": "F-4 tool surface count (factual)."
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0021",
      "text": "Serena's symbol-level retrieval tools include `find_symbol`, `get_symbols_overview` (file outline), `find_referencing_symbols`, `find_declaration`, `find_implementations`, and `diagnostics`/inspections.",
      "source_uri": "/workspaces/feature-pipeline/working/feature/devcontainer-mcp-provisioning-r1/research-notes/T-001-serena.md",
      "source_type": "community_blog",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "claude_code",
