      "notes": "F-4 basic-utility enumeration (factual)."
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0025",
      "text": "Serena provides a memory-management subsystem of project-scoped notes the agent can write and recall, plus onboarding/project-init tools (`onboarding`, project-config commands).",
      "source_uri": "/workspaces/feature-pipeline/working/feature/devcontainer-mcp-provisioning-r1/research-notes/T-001-serena.md",
      "source_type": "community_blog",
