    {
      "id": "C-0028",
      "text": "Serena's non-symbolic basic utilities (`search_for_pattern`, `read_file`, etc.) duplicate native Claude Code capabilities and contribute most of the context-window cost without unique value on a markdown-heavy repo.",
      "source_uri": "/workspaces/feature-pipeline/working/feature/devcontainer-mcp-provisioning-r1/research-notes/T-001-serena.md",
